Package: com.ofx.sirigpt
Name: SiriGPT
Depends: substitute, preferenceloader
Version: 1.2.0~ios14plus
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Connects Siri to ChatGPT via OpenAI API directly. No app opens. Hooks Siri, ships your query to ChatGPT, speaks the answer back. Configure your OpenAI API key in Settings.
Maintainer: ofx
Section: Tweaks
Homepage: https://github.com/noname7821/SiriGPT
